{"id":"vod_sn_39209","vodId":"39209","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"钢壳都市雷吉欧斯","name_cn":"钢壳都市雷吉欧斯","date":"2009-01-01","year":"2009","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/cd7c56856bb18f7e9459cfea2888c3e2.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在遥远的未来，彼时，地球已经被人类所制造的污染破坏殆尽，更有污染产生了邪恶怪兽横行占领了人类的生存空间。无奈之下，人类只能移居到了拥有独立意识的“自律型移动都市”之中，而这些都市之间，则为了争夺少之又少的资源而展开了激烈的争斗。　　在学院都市洁儿尼中发生了一场骚乱，刚刚入学就读于普通教育系的新生雷冯（冈本信彦 配音）在混乱之中展现了自己出色的应变和战斗的能力，因此被学生会长发掘，转入了武技系，更获得了加入都市护卫第十七小队的资格。外冷内热沉默寡言的菲丽、恪尽职守坚韧强悍的妮娜、个性轻浮但十分可靠的夏尼德，这些奋战在前线的伙伴们，为了守护他们赖以生存的都市，甘愿付出血的代价。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:08:14","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eFjjJvRNU51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/60tDKAhHG21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H5BkBBYvm91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3X9phLynZg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uqh5VDDkrS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u7yfguT0Pc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MJpx6XfP241/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bVJ4ZNJYQm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/H1VAJbFweS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5fhFS3wUxt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BhdE4JMfaM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h8FPzz8Rk01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cjFVy6PNT91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mLr7eS3sn51/video/index.m3u8"},